2026-04-03 04:06:01 [gemini-3.1-lite] Why this happens
2026-04-03 04:06:01 [gemini-3.1-lite] The Google Generative AI SDK for Node/Deno maps the `response` field directly to a
2026-04-03 04:06:01 [gemini-3.1-lite] `google.protobuf.Struct`. A `Struct` in protobuf is a dictionary (key-value pairs) and does not
2026-04-03 04:06:01 [gemini-3.1-lite] accept a raw string as its value. By passing the string `"{...}"`, the API rejects the request
2026-04-03 04:06:01 [gemini-3.1-lite] because it sees a string where it expects a map/object structure.
