2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] method.
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] Strict decoders (like the one in VS Code/Electron) often complain if the Global Color Table
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] size does not match the Pixel Data range, or if the Logical Screen Descriptor
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] fields (`buf[5]` and `buf[6]`) are not set correctly.
