2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] The "VS Code" Compliance Fix
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] In your `begin()` method, you have:
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] buf[5] = 0; // Background color index (0)
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] buf[6] = 0; // Pixel aspect ratio (0 = default)
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] While `0` is the default, some strict decoders expect the Background Color Index to be a
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] valid index within your table (0-15).
2026-04-06 12:08:49 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
