2026-04-06 12:35:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] Note on `Pixmap16.point4`
2026-04-06 12:35:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] Your `point4` logic is correct for extracting 4-bit values from the packed `Uint32Array`. Ensure
2026-04-06 12:35:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] that when you call `addFrame`, you are passing the correct `minCodeSize` (4) to the file stream,
2026-04-06 12:35:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] which you are currently doing (`this.file!.writeSync(new Uint8Array([4]));`).
2026-04-06 12:35:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
