2026-04-07 15:51:02 [gemini-3.1-lite] │  **GP4**  │  Pb             │  Blue-Yellow Difference (PDM)         │
2026-04-07 15:51:02 [gemini-3.1-lite] │  **GP5**  │  Pr             │  Red-Cyan Difference (PDM)            │
