2026-04-07 15:51:02 [gemini-3.1-lite] Trim Logic
2026-04-07 15:51:02 [gemini-3.1-lite] • RC Network: 1kΩ series resistor from GP6 to a 10µF capacitor to ground.
2026-04-07 15:51:02 [gemini-3.1-lite] • Attenuation: Connect a 10kΩ resistor from the Y, Pb, and Pr lines to the filtered node of
2026-04-07 15:51:02 [gemini-3.1-lite] the GP6 RC network.
2026-04-07 15:51:02 [gemini-3.1-lite] • Operation: Varying the GP6 PWM duty cycle changes the DC bias on the common node,
2026-04-07 15:51:02 [gemini-3.1-lite] adjusting the attenuation level across all three channels simultaneously.
2026-04-07 15:51:03 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
