2026-04-07 17:05:15 [gemini-3.1-pro] X] + [Lowest 4 bits of X] + [0]`:
2026-04-07 17:05:15 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-04-07 17:05:15 [gemini-3.1-pro] • X = 00000: Yields `00000 0000 0` (0/10)
