2026-04-07 17:05:15 [gemini-3.1-pro] • X = 00001: Yields `00001 0001 0` (2/10)
2026-04-07 17:05:15 [gemini-3.1-pro] • X = 00101: Yields `00101 0101 0` (4/10)
2026-04-07 17:05:15 [gemini-3.1-pro] • X = 10101: Yields `10101 0101 0` (5/10)
