2026-04-07 17:05:15 [gemini-3.1-pro] • X = 10111: Yields `10111 0111 0` (7/10)
2026-04-07 17:05:15 [gemini-3.1-pro] • X = 11111: Yields `11111 1111 0` (9/10)
