2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] In your `slopfountain.ts` file, you are manually constructing the `FunctionCall` objects inside the
2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] `connectGoogle` function (around line 970). The Google Generative AI SDK expects the API response
2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] to conform to the schema required by the specific model version.
