2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] 2. Update your Tool Call mapping: In the `connectGoogle` definition, ensure that when you
2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] parse `result.response.functionCalls()`, you are not stripping or ignoring the `thought_signature`
2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] field if it is present in the underlying Gemini response.
2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] If the model is returning a `functionCall` that lacks this signature, you may need to explicitly
2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] check if the model is in "reasoning mode". You can modify your `processToolCalls` or the
2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] `generateContent` response handler to look for the signature:
2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
2026-04-09 09:39:10 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
