2026-04-17 20:27:04 [gemini-3.1-pro] channel, the CPU no longer needs to manually feed the FIFO. However, this block is still sitting in
2026-04-17 20:27:04 [gemini-3.1-pro] your `while (true)` loop:
2026-04-17 20:27:04 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
