2026-04-17 20:38:45 [gemini-3.1-pro] explicitly clears the IRQ using `irq clear 0`, combined with the 360-bit safety cutoff.
2026-04-17 20:38:45 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-04-17 20:38:45 [gemini-3.1-pro] 1. The Corrected `wst.pio`
