2026-04-17 20:58:13 [gemini-3.1-pro] immediately tell us if the problem is electrical (the WST output is still stepping on the video
2026-04-17 20:58:13 [gemini-3.1-pro] sync) or logical (the DMA/State Machine is crashing and halting the whole system).
