2026-04-17 20:58:13 [gemini-3.1-pro] `null` register. We can also comment out the `set` instructions so the state machine never touches
2026-04-17 20:58:13 [gemini-3.1-pro] the GPIO pin, while still consuming the exact same number of cycles and FIFO words.
