2026-04-17 21:49:50 [gemini-3.1-pro] the entire active window. Because the hardware ORs the state machines together, `vidblitOUT (1)
2026-04-17 21:49:50 [gemini-3.1-pro] | wstOUT (0) = 1`.
2026-04-17 21:49:50 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-04-17 21:49:50 [gemini-3.1-pro] You do not need to set `pins` in the Teletext state machine at all. `vidblit` is already providing
2026-04-17 21:49:50 [gemini-3.1-pro] the 3.3V level; `wst` just needs to open the gate (`pindirs`).
2026-04-17 21:49:50 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
