2026-04-17 22:14:26 [gemini-3.1-pro] There is also a brilliant, unintended synergy in how your system handles the pin multiplexing
2026-04-17 22:14:26 [gemini-3.1-pro] during the VBI:
2026-04-17 22:14:26 [gemini-3.1-pro] In `vidblit.pio`, pixels are drawn by toggling `pindirs` while `pins` is held High. Because you
