2026-04-17 23:45:22 [kimi-k2.5] Remove `pull,block` from the PIO and rely entirely on autopull, but you'll need to restructure to
2026-04-17 23:45:22 [kimi-k2.5] handle the bit count differently, likely by encoding the bit count into the PIO program itself or
2026-04-17 23:45:22 [kimi-k2.5] using a different approach. The manual pull is cleaner for this application.
2026-04-17 23:45:22 [kimi-k2.5] 
2026-04-17 23:45:22 [kimi-k2.5] With autopull disabled, the 368 bits will stream out contiguously from the 12 words without gaps or
2026-04-17 23:45:22 [kimi-k2.5] skips.
2026-04-17 23:45:22 [kimi-k2.5] 
