2026-04-18 00:18:33 [kimi-k2.5] Teletext overlay, I2S audio, and PS/2 keyboard input. The architecture leverages three PIO state
2026-04-18 00:18:33 [kimi-k2.5] machines on two PIO blocks with DMA pacing.
