2026-04-18 00:18:33 [kimi-k2.5] • PIO Clock Configuration*
2026-04-18 00:18:33 [kimi-k2.5] The WST clock divider `10.7027f` appears to target 6.9375 Mbps for Teletext bit timing. Consider
2026-04-18 00:18:33 [kimi-k2.5] defining this as a constant with calculation commentary:
2026-04-18 00:18:33 [kimi-k2.5] 
2026-04-18 00:18:33 [kimi-k2.5] 
