2026-04-18 00:18:33 [kimi-k2.5] PIO programs (vidblit.pio and wst.pio) use `out pin` commands compatible with shared pin usage, or
2026-04-18 00:18:33 [kimi-k2.5] implement proper state machine arbitration to avoid bus contention.
