2026-04-18 00:18:34 [kimi-k2.5] The dual-field DMA buffer approach for interlaced video is elegant. The separation of even/odd
2026-04-18 00:18:34 [kimi-k2.5] frame pointers with different word counts (`wordCount` vs `wordCount + words`) suggests you're
2026-04-18 00:18:34 [kimi-k2.5] handling the half-line offset for interlace synchronization.
