2026-04-18 00:18:34 [kimi-k2.5] • PS/2 Timing Note*
2026-04-18 00:18:34 [kimi-k2.5] If moving PS/2 to PIO1 (sharing with I2S), verify the clock domains. PS/2 typically requires
2026-04-18 00:18:34 [kimi-k2.5] 10-16.7 kHz clock sampling, which is significantly slower than I2S rates. The state machine clock
2026-04-18 00:18:34 [kimi-k2.5] dividers will need careful configuration to handle both protocols on the same PIO block.
