2026-04-18 06:31:11 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
2026-04-18 06:31:11 [gpt-5.4-2026] And then you pack 12 words = 48 bytes, so one trailing zero byte is also sent.
2026-04-18 06:31:12 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
