2026-04-18 06:31:12 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
2026-04-18 06:31:12 [gpt-5.4-2026] 368 bits = 46 bytes.
2026-04-18 06:31:12 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
2026-04-18 06:31:12 [gpt-5.4-2026] But your packed payload is effectively 48 bytes in memory, and your PIO seems to use a word count /
2026-04-18 06:31:12 [gpt-5.4-2026] bit count convention that is not documented clearly enough here.
