2026-04-18 06:31:13 [gpt-5.4-2026] That may be fine, but teletext is very sensitive to:
2026-04-18 06:31:13 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
2026-04-18 06:31:13 [gpt-5.4-2026] - bit order
2026-04-18 06:31:13 [gpt-5.4-2026] - exact CRI pattern
2026-04-18 06:31:13 [gpt-5.4-2026] - framing code polarity/order
