2026-04-18 06:50:51 [gpt-5.4-2026] Why this matters so much
2026-04-18 06:50:51 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
2026-04-18 06:50:51 [gpt-5.4-2026] If the address bytes are wrong, the decoder may misclassify the packet as:
2026-04-18 06:50:51 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
2026-04-18 06:50:51 [gpt-5.4-2026] - wrong row
2026-04-18 06:50:52 [gpt-5.4-2026] - wrong magazine
2026-04-18 06:50:52 [gpt-5.4-2026] - different pages over time depending on marginal bit decisions
