2026-04-18 07:00:44 [gpt-5.4-2026] The main issue still present
2026-04-18 07:00:44 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
2026-04-18 07:00:44 [gpt-5.4-2026] Your address bytes are still built like this:
2026-04-18 07:00:44 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
2026-04-18 07:00:44 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
2026-04-18 07:00:44 [gpt-5.4-2026] mag &= 7;
2026-04-18 07:00:44 [gpt-5.4-2026] packet[4] = HAMMING_84[mag & 1];
