2026-04-18 07:27:09 [gpt-5.4-2026] So your `irq set 0` occurs about 12.17 µs after the previous active section ended, or
2026-04-18 07:27:09 [gpt-5.4-2026] equivalently about after sync + porches, at active-video start.
2026-04-18 07:27:09 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
2026-04-18 07:27:09 [gpt-5.4-2026] For teletext, the burst should start about 12 µs from sync edge, not from active start.
2026-04-18 07:27:09 [gpt-5.4-2026] 
