2026-04-18 07:46:30 [gpt-5.4-2026] set	y, 28
2026-04-18 07:46:30 [gpt-5.4-2026] backporch:
2026-04-18 07:46:30 [gpt-5.4-2026] 	jmp	y--,backporch [29]
2026-04-18 07:46:30 [gpt-5.4-2026] jmp	x--,line [15]
