2026-04-18 08:10:38 [kimi-k2.5] - Target: ~11.1 µs start (~0.6 µs later)
2026-04-18 08:10:38 [kimi-k2.5] - Method: Increase back porch by 3 chunks (90 cycles), decrease active pixel count on VBI
2026-04-18 08:10:38 [kimi-k2.5] lines by 9
2026-04-18 08:10:38 [kimi-k2.5] - Do not: Reduce back porch (makes it ~9.7 µs, too early) or add large WST delays
2026-04-18 08:10:38 [kimi-k2.5] (overflows line)
