2026-04-20 16:38:00 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:38:00 [grok-4.20-0309] - RP2040 → Dual Cortex-M0+ (purely ARM)
2026-04-20 16:38:00 [grok-4.20-0309] - RP2350 → Dual Cortex-M33 (ARM) + Dual Hazard3 (RISC-V)
