2026-04-20 16:38:00 [grok-4.20-0309] - Boot into ARM mode (using the two Cortex-M33 cores), or
2026-04-20 16:38:00 [grok-4.20-0309] - Boot into RISC-V mode (using the two Hazard3 cores)
