2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] • Short and direct answer:*
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] • No, it is not fully backward compatible.*
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] Here’s the clear situation for the RP2350 (Cortex-M33):
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] What changed:
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] - The RP2040’s Cortex-M0+ only understood Thumb (16-bit instructions only).
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] - The RP2350’s Cortex-M33 only understands Thumb-2.
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] • Your current `thumb2.h` generates pure Thumb (16-bit) code.*
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] That code will NOT run on the RP2350 if you try to execute it directly on the Cortex-M33
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] cores.
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] The M33 cores expect proper Thumb-2 encoding. While many 16-bit Thumb instructions are still valid
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] inside Thumb-2, your current generator is incomplete because:
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] - It doesn’t emit the 32-bit prefix when needed.
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] - It doesn’t support many instructions that the M33 can (and sometimes must) use.
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] - Some subtle encoding differences exist.
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] Practical reality:
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] ╭────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────╮
2026-04-20 16:46:42 [grok-4.20-0309] │  Instruction type              │  Works on RP2040 (M0+)  │  Works on RP2350 (M33)    │  Your current code  │
2026-04-20 16:46:43 [grok-4.20-0309] ├────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼─────────────────────┤
2026-04-20 16:46:43 [grok-4.20-0309] │  Most 16-bit Thumb             │  Yes                    │  Yes                      │  Yes                │
2026-04-20 16:46:43 [grok-4.20-0309] │  Thumb-2 32-bit instr.         │  No                     │  Yes                      │  No                 │
2026-04-20 16:46:43 [grok-4.20-0309] │  `movw`, `movt`, `ldr.w` etc.  │  No                     │  Required for many cases  │  No                 │
2026-04-20 16:46:43 [grok-4.20-0309] ╰────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┴─────────────────────╯
2026-04-20 16:46:43 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 16:46:43 [grok-4.20-0309] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
