2026-04-20 17:00:09 [grok-4.20-0309] 
2026-04-20 17:00:09 [grok-4.20-0309] You have now applied the `_n` suffix to almost all narrow instructions. That matches the convention
2026-04-20 17:00:09 [grok-4.20-0309] we discussed.
