2026-04-20 20:16:59 [gpt-5.3-codex] - `TBB/TBH` (jump-table style dispatch, optional)
2026-04-20 20:16:59 [gpt-5.3-codex] - `BKPT`/`UDF` (debug/trap hooks, very handy)
2026-04-20 20:16:59 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
