2026-04-20 20:16:59 [gpt-5.3-codex] - `BL` wide (direct)
2026-04-20 20:16:59 [gpt-5.3-codex] - `BLX reg` (indirect)
2026-04-20 20:16:59 [gpt-5.3-codex] - `BX lr` (return)
2026-04-20 20:16:59 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
