2026-04-23 07:32:23 [nitro@ryzen5] i am als generating WST teletext bitstream on same pin
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] Ah, that changes everything! For teletext data, you need much faster edges than for standard video.
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] WST teletext uses 6.9375 MHz data rate, which requires significantly faster rise times.
