2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] Teletext Requirements
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] • WST (World System Teletext) specifications:*
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] - Data rate: 6.9375 Mbit/s
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] - Bit period: 144 ns
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] - Required rise/fall time: Typically < 30% of bit period = < 43 ns
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] - Ideally: < 20% = < 29 ns for clean eye pattern
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] Re-evaluating Our Circuits
