2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] - Rise time: 9.94ns (calculated)
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] - This is excellent for teletext (well under 29 ns)
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-04-23 07:33:01 [deepseek-chat] Option 2: 390Ω/180Ω
2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] - Rise time: 10.21ns
2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] - Also excellent for teletext
