2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] 1. Fastest possible edges
2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] 2. Proper impedance matching to minimize reflections
2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] 3. Minimal ringing
