2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] Optimized Circuit for Teletext + Video
2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] Since you're multiplexing video and teletext on the same pin, we need to balance:
2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] - Video: Needs proper DC bias (0.3V black, 0.77V white)
2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] - Teletext: Needs fast edges and proper termination
