2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] - Rise time: τ = 35.9Ω × 100pF = 3.59ns
2026-04-23 07:33:02 [deepseek-chat] - t_rise = 2.2 × 3.59ns = 7.90ns (even faster!)
