2026-04-23 12:23:03 [gemini-3.1-pro] Everything else in your code—the DMA sizes, the Hamming encoding, the parity, and the `wstBody`
2026-04-23 12:23:03 [gemini-3.1-pro] math—is perfectly correct! Once you fix that array pointer, your sync will return and you should
2026-04-23 12:23:03 [gemini-3.1-pro] see your body row appear.
