2026-04-23 16:39:15 [gpt-5.3-codex] for one packet, but adding another row on the same line doubles active teletext time if you
2026-04-23 16:39:15 [gpt-5.3-codex] accidentally send both under one trigger.
2026-04-23 16:39:15 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Line scheduling mismatch: your DMA list is “one control word per video line”. If you
