2026-04-23 16:39:15 [gpt-5.3-codex] as video. Two rows may push energy into porch/sync depending on start delay.
2026-04-23 16:39:15 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Clock divisor accuracy: `10,180` at 148.5 MHz gives ~13.8785 MHz, close but slightly
2026-04-23 16:39:15 [gpt-5.3-codex] high. Usually tolerated, but marginal TVs plus timing overrun can lose lock.
