2026-04-23 16:39:15 [gpt-5.3-codex] - `wst.pio` does one `out x,32` per IRQ(line), then either sends `x` bits or nothing.
2026-04-23 16:39:15 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Therefore each line should only ever schedule one packet max with one count word and its
