2026-04-24 11:55:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-04-24 11:55:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-24 11:55:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] Even vs odd field in your architecture
2026-04-24 11:55:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-24 11:55:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] Same 5+5+5 pattern in both fields, but the sequence is shifted by half a line between
2026-04-24 11:55:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] fields.
2026-04-24 11:55:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-24 11:55:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] In practical PIO terms:
2026-04-24 11:55:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
