2026-04-24 12:09:50 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Broad half-lines with serration: need at least 3 segments each (low → short high
2026-04-24 12:09:50 [gpt-5.3-codex] notch → low), sometimes more depending how strictly you match pulse placement.
