2026-04-24 12:17:07 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-24 12:17:07 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Old: one word = total vertical low time.
2026-04-24 12:17:07 [gpt-5.3-codex] - New: vertical sequence = 20 pulse components, each with:
2026-04-24 12:17:07 [gpt-5.3-codex] 	- low count
