2026-04-24 12:17:08 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-24 12:17:08 [gpt-5.3-codex] 6) Entry/exit pin state
2026-04-24 12:17:08 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Ensure known output level at sequence start and correct level when returning to normal line
2026-04-24 12:17:08 [gpt-5.3-codex] generator.
2026-04-24 12:17:08 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
