2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] range. If you keep that block, consider using `32` and adjusting the line counts accordingly.
2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] - Code style: Global arrays and variables are acceptable in a single‑file demo, but as the
2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] project grows you might want to encapsulate state in structs and pass them to functions.
2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] 
