2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] - The `vidblit.pio` line loop with separate hsync/back‑porch/active/front‑porch timings is nicely
2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] constructed.
2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] - Using the PIO FIFO directly to stream pixel words is efficient. The DMA chaining idea
2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] (reconfigure every field) is sound once you add the start trigger.
2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] - The C64 font drawing and frame‑buffer bitmap layout are correctly aligned with the PIO’s FIFO
2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] expectations (27 words per line).
2026-04-24 15:43:27 [deepseek-v4-pro] 
