2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] Your sequence:
2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] - loads `x = 19` (20 lines/pulses total because `jmp x--` includes zero),
2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] - drives sync level with `set pins, 0`,
2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] - then per pulse:
