2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] Two practical PAL notes
2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] 1. Half-line handling (interlace/equalizing)
2026-04-24 16:36:21 [gpt-5.3-codex] 	PAL vertical sync usually needs equalizing pulses and broad pulses with half-line offsets.
