2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 1) Quick frame/field numbering reminder
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] For 625/50 interlaced PAL, digital-era line numbering is commonly:
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Field 1: lines 1–313
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Field 2: lines 314–625
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] Active video is typically:
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Field 1: starts at line 23
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Field 2: starts at line 336
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] So active picture is 23–310 and 336–623 (576 active lines total).
