2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 2) Vertical interval structure around field start
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] At each field boundary you get:
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - pre-equalizing pulses
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - serrated vertical sync pulses
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - post-equalizing pulses
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] This pulse train spans the first few lines of each field (including half-line timing), then normal
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] blanked lines continue until active video starts.
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 3) Common PAL-B/G line usage (broadcast practice)
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] Field 1 (lines 1–22 are VBI)
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - 1–5: vertical sync/equalizing region (timing pulses; no payload)
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - 6–22: vertical blanked lines, often used for data/test
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 	- Line 6–22: may carry Teletext, VITC, test signals, or be left blank depending on network
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 	- Line 16 (often): WSS (where used; 625 systems commonly place WSS on line 23 in
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] some practices, but implementation varies by country/operator)
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 	- Line 19/20 (often): VPS/PDC in some European services
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 	- VITC: often on one or more VBI lines (commonly around 19/20 or nearby),
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] operator-dependent
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - 23: first active video line (also historically used for signalling in some setups, so
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] you’ll see regional differences)
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] Field 2 (lines 314–335 are VBI)
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - 314–318: vertical sync/equalizing region
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - 319–335: vertical blanked/data-capable lines
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 	- Teletext commonly mirrored in both fields on selected lines
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 	- VITC can also be placed in field 2 VBI lines
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - 336: first active video line
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 4) Teletext line conventions (common)
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] In 625-line PAL countries, Teletext packets are commonly inserted on selected VBI lines, frequently
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] within:
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Field 1: roughly lines 7–22
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Field 2: roughly lines 320–335
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] Exact occupied subset depends on broadcaster multiplex capacity.
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-25 09:48:57 [gpt-5.3-codex] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
