2026-04-26 09:37:34 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-26 09:37:34 [gpt-5.3-codex] In many implementations, people use a subset (e.g., starting around line 10) for margin/safety, but
2026-04-26 09:37:34 [gpt-5.3-codex] the canonical broadcast range is 7–22 per field.
