2026-04-26 15:36:53 [gpt-5.3-codex] Yes — on RP2350 specifically, some system clock values can produce more timing jitter/unevenness
2026-04-26 15:36:53 [gpt-5.3-codex] than others due to PLL divisors/fractional synthesis behavior and clock tree division
2026-04-26 15:36:53 [gpt-5.3-codex] relationships.
2026-04-26 15:36:53 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-26 15:36:53 [gpt-5.3-codex] So 166.5 MHz vs 150 MHz can differ in “evenness” even outside video context.
