2026-04-26 15:37:40 [gpt-5.3-codex] So, in your terms:
2026-04-26 15:37:40 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Cleanest absolute: XOSC-derived clock.
2026-04-26 15:37:40 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Cleanest high-speed practical: PLL at an integer-multiple plan with integer downstream
2026-04-26 15:37:40 [gpt-5.3-codex] divisors.
2026-04-26 15:37:41 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
