2026-04-26 15:40:12 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Bit-to-bit timing wander directly hurts lock margin.
2026-04-26 15:40:12 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Extra deterministic periodic jitter (from awkward clock/divider choices) is worse than tiny
