2026-04-26 15:56:43 [nitro@ryzen5] Dual PLL Architecture: Like the RP2040, the RP2350 features two independent PLLs.PLL_SYS: Generates the system clock, running at a standard 150 MHz (up from 125 MHz on the RP2040).PLL_USB: Specifically designed to provide a stable 48 MHz clock for the USB 1.1 PHY.Oscillator Requirements: The PLLs are typically driven by a crystal oscillator connected to the XIN and XOUT pins. While 12 MHz is standard, the system is flexible and can be synchronised to external sources between 10 MHz and 100 MHz, though higher source frequencies may require careful configuration to avoid degrading performance.
