2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] Practical implications:
2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] - Using exact XOSC-derived target frequencies is necessary, but not sufficient.
