2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] So your decision flow should be:
2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] 1. Keep exact spec math (you already do).
2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] 2. Choose candidate SYS clocks (e.g. 166.5, 152.625, 138.75).
2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] 3. For each, use clean integer PLL config.
2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] 4. Measure run-in edge spread on scope.
2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] 5. Pick the one with lowest measured jitter on your board.
2026-04-26 15:56:48 [gpt-5.3-codex] 
