2026-04-29 11:27:20 [deepseek-v4-pro] │  **Back porch**        │  `set pindirs,0` (1) + `set pins,1` (1) + `set y,29` (1) + 30×(`jmp y-- … [31]`, 32 cycles each)  │  963        │  5.782          │  –0.018 µs               │
2026-04-29 11:27:20 [deepseek-v4-pro] │  **Active video**      │  `mov y,isr` (1) + 864×(`out pindirs,1 [8]` 9 cycles + `jmp y-- …` 1 cycle)                       │  8641       │  51.881         │  –0.119 µs               │
2026-04-29 11:27:20 [deepseek-v4-pro] │  **Front porch**       │  `set pindirs,0` (1) + `set y,7` (1) + 8×(`jmp y-- … [31]`, 32 cycles each)                       │  258        │  1.549          │  –0.001 µs               │
2026-04-29 11:27:20 [deepseek-v4-pro] │  **Loop overhead**     │  `jmp x--,line [7]`                                                                               │  8          │  0.048          │  —                       │
2026-04-29 11:27:20 [deepseek-v4-pro] │  **Total per line**    │                                                                                                   │  **10656**  │  **64.000**     │  **perfect**             │
