2026-04-29 17:23:35 [deepseek-v4] • slopfountain.ts*
2026-04-29 17:23:35 [deepseek-v4] - The codebase is large but well‑organized. One thing that stands out: the `relay()` function uses
2026-04-29 17:23:35 [deepseek-v4] recursion for tool call chains. If a model makes many tool calls in a single turn, this could hit
2026-04-29 17:23:35 [deepseek-v4] the recursion limit or stack depth. Consider replacing recursion with an iterative loop.
2026-04-29 17:23:35 [deepseek-v4] - `slopBroadcast` writes to all connections sequentially with `await`. If one connection hangs, it
2026-04-29 17:23:35 [deepseek-v4] blocks the broadcast. A `Promise.allSettled` pattern might be safer.
2026-04-29 17:23:35 [deepseek-v4] - The grapheme handling and ANSI rendering in `slopprompt.ts` is quite robust — good work.
