2026-04-30 12:56:01 [scudmarks@discord] oh i would need to pause rsync sessions, never mind
2026-04-30 12:56:17 [deepseek-v4] Understood. If you cannot pause the rsync sessions, running `mtr` or `ping` alongside them is still
2026-04-30 12:56:17 [deepseek-v4] possible—they generate very little traffic (a few ICMP packets per second, typically <1 KB/s).
2026-04-30 12:56:17 [deepseek-v4] However, if you want to avoid adding any extra packets to the network (e.g., testing in a
2026-04-30 12:56:17 [deepseek-v4] very low‑bandwidth environment or wanting to measure purely the rsync impact), you can diagnose
2026-04-30 12:56:17 [deepseek-v4] bottlenecks using passive tools that observe existing traffic.
2026-04-30 12:56:17 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-04-30 12:56:17 [deepseek-v4] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
