2026-04-30 12:57:12 [deepseek-v4] 2. Round‑trip latency
2026-04-30 12:57:12 [deepseek-v4]    - Path from your Archlinux host (New Zealand, based on timezone +12:00) to Singapore: ~31 ms.
2026-04-30 12:57:12 [deepseek-v4]    - Then a large jump to ~122 ms (Singapore → final destination, likely in China or Hong Kong).
2026-04-30 12:57:12 [deepseek-v4]    - Total RTT: 122 ms – consistent with a trans‑pacific or international fibre route.
