2026-05-01 13:45:52 [nitro@ryzen5] my new app is failing verification i will modify some stuff
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] Got it. Discord app verification can be quite strict, especially for new bots.
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] Before you start modifying things, it’s good to know what Discord is actually checking
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] during verification.
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] Common Reasons New Apps Fail Verification
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] Here’s what usually causes failures:
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] ╭─────┬──────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] │  #  │  Issue                           │  Why It Fails                                        │  How to Fix                                    │
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] ├─────┼──────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] │  1  │  **Missing Privacy Policy**      │  Required for all bots                               │  Add a real Privacy Policy URL                 │
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] │  2  │  **Missing Terms of Service**    │  Required for all bots                               │  Add a Terms of Service URL                    │
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] │  3  │  **Vague / Salesy Description**  │  "AI chatbot" or "fun bot" often gets rejected       │  Be specific about what the bot actually does  │
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] │  4  │  **No Support Server**           │  They want a way to contact you                      │  Add a Support Server link                     │
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] │  5  │  **Bot isn't functional**        │  If the bot doesn't respond or do anything useful    │  Make sure it has working commands/features    │
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] │  6  │  **Misleading claims**           │  Saying it has features it doesn't actually have     │  Keep the description accurate                 │
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] │  7  │  **Too many servers too fast**   │  New bots are limited until verified                 │  Grow slowly and naturally                     │
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] │  8  │  **Privileged Intents**          │  Using Message Content Intent without justification  │  Only enable what you actually need            │
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] ╰─────┴──────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
2026-05-01 13:46:04 [grok-4.3] 
