2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 1. Make Sure Your Support Server Looks Proper
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] Even a small server should have these basics:
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] - Server Name — Something clear like `SlopFountain Support` or `Fountain AI Help`
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] - Rules Channel (or pinned rules in `#welcome`)
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] - Support Channel (where users can ask questions)
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] - Your Bot should be in the server (recommended)
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] Would you like me to suggest a simple channel structure for your support server?
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 2. Create a Permanent Invite Link
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] This is important. You need to generate an invite link and add it to the Developer Portal.
