2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 2. Open your application
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 3. Go to General Information
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 4. Find the field called Support Server
2026-05-01 13:48:19 [grok-4.3] 5. Paste your invite link there
