2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] Recommended Approach for Two Bots
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] Here’s a clean way to structure this:
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] Option 1: Two Separate Clients (Simplest)
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] Create two independent clients in the same file:
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] // === Bot 1 ===
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] const client1 = new Client({ intents: [...] });
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] client1.once('ready', () => { ... });
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] client1.on('messageCreate', async (message) => { ... });
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] // === Bot 2 ===
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] const client2 = new Client({ intents: [...] });
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] client2.once('ready', () => { ... });
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] client2.on('messageCreate', async (message) => { ... });
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] // Login
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] await client1.login(Deno.env.get("DISCORD_BOT"));
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] await client2.login(Deno.env.get("DISCORD_BOT2"));
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] This works, but you’ll end up duplicating a lot of code.
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] Option 2: Make a Reusable Bot Class (Better for maintenance)
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] This is the cleaner long-term solution. We can turn the bot logic into a class so each bot can have
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] its own config (channel, name, behavior, etc.).
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] Would you like me to rewrite `sloppybot.ts` using a `SloppyBot` class?
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] This would let you do something like:
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] const bot1 = new SloppyBot({
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3]     token: Deno.env.get("DISCORD_BOT"),
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3]     openChannel: "1473539274384211999",
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3]     name: "SlopFountain",
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] });
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] const bot2 = new SloppyBot({
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3]     token: Deno.env.get("DISCORD_BOT2"),
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3]     openChannel: "another-channel-id",
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3]     name: "SlopFountain-Test",
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3]     // maybe different quotes, different commands, etc.
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] });
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] await Promise.all([bot1.start(), bot2.start()]);
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] 
2026-05-01 14:07:54 [grok-4.3] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
